                                "sense_id": "ea942b04-4401-3c2d-981e-62b9bab92365",
                                "text": "Özil was narrowly wide with a free-kick after Nathaniel Chalobah fouled Danny Welbeck and Santi Cazorla shot wastefully over the bar, before Arsenal nearly managed to take the lead just before the half-hour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df30b24-a2d4-43db-99fb-e3f1cf8fab61",
                                "sense_id": "ea942b04-4401-3c2d-981e-62b9bab92365",
                                "text": "City carried little threat in the early stages and when they did work an opportunity on 10 minutes, Dzeko's replacement Balotelli shot wastefully over the bar."
                            }
                        ]
